{"id":"vod_md_2717","vodId":"2717","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"Keroro军曹","name_cn":"Keroro军曹","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"358集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230818-1/a802e3e217b07d811970c55776f0e501.jpg"},"summary":"真的有外星人么？他们长什么样？来地球做啥？《青蛙军曹》里，这批号称要侵略地球的外星入侵者是来自Gamma星云第58号行星“K隆星”的人，不，更准确的说应该是“蛙”。5蛙先遣小部队来蓝星做取样调查，结果队长keroro军曹行踪败露，被蓝星人日向一家发现并活捉，侵略利器“Kero球”也落到了弟弟日向冬树手里。而大本营侵略飞船见情况不妙，便仓皇逃离。留下了先遣部队5蛙组散落在蓝星，等待后续商讨。无依无靠的keroro开始驻扎在日向家，被日向姐弟监视一举一动，表面顺服的keroro背地里建起了小基地，也在积极联系散落在各地的其它伙伴。其它成员也慢慢现出真身，小部队能达成他们的心愿，攻陷地球么？地球的命运会如何？敬请收看《K隆星大战蓝星》，又名《外星人在地球的幸福生活》。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-18 08:27:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":358,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/2cf7MI2E/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/23EhbRfV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/vGhACBiT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/aB8LsIQB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/0zSWZG6W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/YKNJ3BCj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/cChxT1Iw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/Qwa1gCOy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/NmUHBxaB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/ZUgcCVB0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/gekmudep/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/czxA68y8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/Nb5FYjRx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/lIUUWzSM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://p